        <message_html><![CDATA[<div style="display:none;font-size:1px;color:#f4f6f8;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;">${number} is ready for the delivery backlog and needs your approval.</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f4f6f8;margin:0;padding:0;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:28px 12px;"><table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e3e8ee;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;"><tr><td height="5" style="height:5px;font-size:0;line-height:0;background-color:#63df4e;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#63df4e,#8fe87f);">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#032d42" style="padding:17px 32px;background-color:#032d42;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:0.02em;">PTAG</span><span style="font-size:14px;color:#7f9aa8;">&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#63df4e;letter-spacing:0.09em;text-transform:uppercase;">Engagement Hub</span></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:14px 32px 30px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#1f2a3a;"><h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;color:#032d42;">An acceptance needs your approval.</h1><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#1f2a3a;">Hi ${approver.first_name},</p><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#1f2a3a;"><strong>${number}</strong> has been assessed by the PTAG team and is ready to move into the delivery backlog. That step needs your sign-off as the responsible group manager.</p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:6px 0 4px;border-top:1px solid #e3e8ee;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e8ee;width:100%;"><tr><td style="padding:7px 14px 7px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#8593a6;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;">Request</td><td style="padding:7px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#1f2a3a;">${number}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:7px 14px 7px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#8593a6;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;">Summary</td><td style="padding:7px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#1f2a3a;">${short_description}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:7px 14px 7px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#8593a6;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;">Practice</td><td style="padding:7px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#1f2a3a;">${practice}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:7px 14px 7px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#8593a6;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;">Partner</td><td style="padding:7px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#1f2a3a;">${partner}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:7px 14px 7px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#8593a6;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;">Requested by</td><td style="padding:7px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#1f2a3a;">${opened_by}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:7px 14px 7px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#8593a6;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;">Status</td><td style="padding:7px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#1f2a3a;">${state}</td></tr></table><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:20px 0 4px;"><tr><td bgcolor="#032d42" style="border-radius:6px;background-color:#032d42;"><a href="https://astrodev.service-now.com/x_snc_ptag_engage_engagement_request.do?sys_id=${sys_id}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">Review and decide</a></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#1f2a3a;"><span style="font-size:12px;color:#8593a6;">This request also appears under My Approvals in ServiceNow. Approving moves it to In Backlog and opens the delivery engagement; rejecting returns it to Under Review with your notes.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:16px 32px 20px;border-top:1px solid #e3e8ee;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#8593a6;">PTAG Engagement Hub &middot; Partner Technology Acceleration Group<br>You're receiving this because you are the approver for ${number} in the PTAG Engagement Hub.</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>]]></message_html>
